# IIQ Angular 18 Naming Conventions

**Critical: kebab-case is enforced by ESLint for all `web/ui/ts/` files.** Don't use camelCase or PascalCase for filenames in the Angular 18 codebase.

## Files

| Type | Convention | Example |
|------|-----------|---------|
| TS component | kebab-case + `.component.ts` | `dropdown.component.ts`, `reconfigure-modal.component.ts` |
| TS service | kebab-case + `.service.ts` | `application-definition.service.ts` |
| TS interface | kebab-case + `.interface.ts` | `application-data.interface.ts` |
| TS pipe | kebab-case + `.pipe.ts` | `date-format.pipe.ts` |
| TS directive | kebab-case + `.directive.ts` | `auto-focus.directive.ts` |
| TS module | kebab-case + `.module.ts` | `application-definition.module.ts` |
| Component template | kebab-case + `.component.html` (in `template/` subfolder) | `template/dropdown.component.html` |
| NgRx actions | kebab-case + `.actions.ts` | `application-definition.actions.ts` |
| NgRx reducer | kebab-case + `.reducer.ts` | `application-definition.reducer.ts` |
| NgRx effects | kebab-case + `.effects.ts` | `application-definition.effects.ts` |
| NgRx selectors | kebab-case + `.selectors.ts` | `application-definition.selectors.ts` |
| Test file | kebab-case + `.spec.ts` | `dropdown.component.spec.ts` |

## Angular 18 elements

| Element | Convention | Example |
|---------|-----------|---------|
| Component selector | kebab-case, `sp-` prefix | `<sp-dropdown>`, `<sp-datatable>` |
| Component class | PascalCase + `Component` suffix | `DropdownComponent`, `ReconfigureModalComponent` |
| Service class | PascalCase + `Service` suffix | `ApplicationDefinitionService` |
| Interface | PascalCase, no `I` prefix | `ApplicationData`, `DropdownOption` |
| Module class | PascalCase + `Module` suffix | `ApplicationDefinitionModule` |
| Input binding name | camelCase, `sp` prefix | `@Input('spOptions')`, `@Input('spDisabled')` |
| Output binding name | camelCase, `sp` prefix | `@Output('spOnSelect')`, `@Output('spOnChange')` |
| NgRx action | `[Feature] Verb Description` | `[Application Definition] Load Applications` |
| NgRx selector | camelCase, `select` prefix | `selectAllApplications`, `selectIsLoading` |
| Constants | UPPER_SNAKE_CASE | `MAX_PAGE_SIZE`, `DEFAULT_TIMEOUT` |
